unless they requested them. Sometimes it may be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:50.940
that that network or studio already has an&nbsp;
idea, they already own the IP and they just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:56.520
need a writer to come and write it so they may put&nbsp;
their feelers out to their agents and manage your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.520 --> 00:01:01.380
friends and say we need this kind of writer who&nbsp;
writes this kind of thing and we want them to come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:08.700
