happens sometimes if it's their original idea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:13.320
the screenwriter's original idea then it comes it&nbsp;
comes from the other way they go to the agent or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:18.180
manager and they say hey I have this idea that I&nbsp;
