we have over here is this something you guys are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:32.040
looking for interested in listening to etc, etc&nbsp;
and then if the executive is like yeah come on in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:37.680
and they'll set up the meeting so a screenwriter&nbsp;
should never try to just blindly send their&nbsp;&nbsp;

